Excellent 3 bedroom flat, located on the 2nd floor of a building with lift and two entrances, in a privileged location in Vila Praia de Âncora.

With three fronts, this property stands out for its excellent sun exposure, luminosity and generous areas, providing a comfortable and welcoming environment throughout the day.

The flat consists of:

Entrance hall;

Distribution corridor;

Large living room with access to balcony and pleasant sea view;

Kitchen;

3 bedrooms, one of which is a suite;

2 full bathrooms, one with shower and the other with bathtub;

2 balconies;

2 bedrooms with built-in wardrobes.

It also has heating radiators throughout the house, ensuring greater comfort during the colder months.

In addition, it has an attic and closed garage, offering excellent additional storage and parking spaces.

The location is one of the great assets of this flat, allowing you to enjoy the proximity of beaches, shops, services, restaurants and main accesses, in one of the most sought after areas of Vila Praia de Âncora.

A spacious, bright flat with sea views, ideal for both permanent housing and second residence or investment. 

Energy Rating: E
